censioni aggiornate."],"You have reached the maximum sources limit, Please enter a valid API key to retrieve new sources.":["Hai raggiunto il limite massimo di fonti, inserisci una chiave API valida per recuperare nuove fonti."],"Are you using a local host? API keys may be required for all review retrieving.":["Stai utilizzando un fornitore locale? Potrebbero essere necessarie chiavi API per il recupero di tutte le recensioni."],"Select Source Type":["Seleziona il tipo di sorgente"],"Add Downloads":[""],"Add Source Details":["Aggiungi dettagli sulla fonte"],"Your URL must contain \"\/themes\/\" or \"\/plugins\/\". Examples: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/wordpress.org\/plugins\/instagram-feed\/<\/a>, <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/wordpress.org\/themes\/twentytwentythree\/<\/a>":["L'URL deve contenere \"\/themes\/\" o \"\/plugins\/\". Esempi: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/wordpress.org\/plugins\/instagram-feed\/<\/a>, <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/wordpress.org\/themes\/twentytwentythree\/<\/a>"],"Enter an Airbnb listing URL or numeric ID. Example: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/www.airbnb.com\/rooms\/12345678<\/a>":[""],"Enter a Booking.com hotel URL or numeric ID. Example: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/www.booking.com\/hotel\/us\/hotel-name.html<\/a>":[""],"Enter an AliExpress product URL or numeric ID. Example: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/www.aliexpress.com\/item\/1234567890123.html<\/a>":[""],"Enter the Trustpilot review page URL, not just the domain. Example: <a href=\"#\">https:\/\/www.trustpilot.com\/review\/www.example.com<\/a>":[""],"Enter a listing URL or ID first.":[""],"That does not look like a valid listing URL or ID. Check it and try again.":[""],"Could not add source. Please check the listing URL or location ID and your API key, then try again.":[""],"Source Limit Exceeded. Please enter API Key.":["Limite della fonte superato. Inserisci la chiave API."],"Source Limit Exceeded.":["Limite della fonte superato."],"Fetching reviews history in the background!":[""],"API Key Added":["Chiave API aggiunta"],"Invalid API Key":["Chiave API non valida"],"Invalid Location ID or URL":["ID della localizzazione o URL non validi"],"Source added successfully":["Fonte aggiunta con successo"],"This source already exists":[""],"\"Elite\"":[""],"\"Plus\" and \"Elite\"":[""],"license tiers only, please upgrade your license on ":[""],"in order to connect a ":["in modo da collegare una "],"source.":["fonte."],"Add Sources":["Aggiungi le fonti"],"ADVANCED SOURCES":["FONTI AVANZATE"],"Handpick reviews with collections":[""],"Select among your reviews and organize them into a collection. Manually create a review for complete control. Once a collection is created, it will appear as a feed source.":[""],"You have reached the allowed the number of sources for ":["Hai raggiunto il numero consentito di fonti per "],"Add an API Key for ":["Aggiungi una chiave API per "],"API key gives us permission to fetch data from ":["La chiave API ci d\u00e0 il permesso di recuperare i dati da "],". You only need to add this once. For any future ":[". Dovrai aggiungerlo solo una volta. Per qualsiasi futuro "]," accounts, we will use the same API key.":[" account, utilizzeremo la stessa chiave API."],"Adding an API key is optional \u2014 your feeds work without one. Without a key, TripAdvisor reviews refresh once a week. Your own key lifts that limit, so they refresh every 12 hours. Keys now come from their Terra platform, which needs a separate account.":[""],"How to Create an API key.":["Come creare una chiave API."],"This helps us identify which page to fetch reviews from":["Questo ci aiuta a identificare la pagina da cui recuperare le recensioni"],"Find your source's":["Trova qui l'ID della posizione"],"place ID here":["della tua fonte"],"Showing":["Mostra"],"Facebook Pages":["Pagine Facebook"],"connected to":["connesso a"],"No products found in your WooCommerce store.":[""],"This will show up in sources panel to make this easy to identify":[""],"Eg. \"Electronic Products\" or \"All products\"":