hortcode"],"Instances":["Istanze"],"Actions":["Azioni"],"Copy Shortcode":["Copia lo shortcode"],"Used in ":["Usato in "],"Duplicate":["Duplica"],"Feed Duplicated":["Feed duplicato"],"Create your feed":["Crea il tuo feed"],"Connect your Google, Facebook, Yelp or Tripadvisor account and choose a feed type":["Collega il tuo account Google, Facebook, Yelp o Tripadvisor e scegli un tipo di feed."],"Customize your feed type":["Personalizza il tuo tipo di feed"],"Choose layouts, color schemes, filters and more":["Scegli layout, schemi di colori, filtri e molto altro."],"Embed your feed":["Incorpora il tuo feed"],"Easily add the feed anywhere on your website":["Aggiungi facilmente il feed in qualsiasi punto del tuo sito web"],"Edit Products":[""],"Enter a name for this source":[""],"Saving...":[""],"Network error. Please check your connection and try again.":[""],"Add Source":["Aggiungi fonte"],"Loading, please wait":[""],"Review Feed Pro by Smash Balloon":["Review Feed Pro di Smash Balloon"],"Activate your plugin to get started":["Attiva il tuo plugin per iniziare"],"Paste license key here":["Incolla qui la chiave di licenza"],"License Activated!":["Licenza attivata!"],"Invalid License!":["Licenza non valida!"],"Don\u2019t have a license key?":["Non hai una chiave di licenza?"],"Buy a License":["Acquista una licenza"],"After activating your plugin, you can...":["Dopo aver attivato il plugin, puoi..."],"Collect New Reviews":["Raccogli nuove recensioni"],"New reviews and data related to the reviews for your business are collected from external sites. Your license key can be used to access this data using Smash Balloon's API site.":["Le nuove recensioni e i dati relativi alle recensioni della tua attivit\u00e0 vengono raccolti da siti esterni. La tua chiave di licenza pu\u00f2 essere utilizzata per accedere a questi dati utilizzando il sito delle API di Smash Balloon."],"With constant changes to WordPress and the APIs that your reviews are retrieved from, your plugin needs to stay up to date. Activating your license allows automatic updates from the Plugins page.":["Con le continue modifiche a WordPress e alle API da cui vengono recuperate le recensioni, il tuo plugin deve rimanere aggiornato. L'attivazione della licenza consente l'aggiornamento automatico dalla pagina dei plugin."],"Receive Technical Support":["Ricevi assistenza tecnica"],"Although we pride ourselves on creating reliable, easy-to-use products our expert support team is here to help with any questions. Activating your license key is recommended to receive efficient support.":["Anche se siamo orgogliosi di creare prodotti affidabili e facili da usare, il nostro team di assistenza \u00e8 a disposizione per rispondere a qualsiasi domanda. L'attivazione della chiave di licenza \u00e8 consigliata per ricevere un'assistenza efficiente."],"Amazing Support Team.":["Un team di assistenza incredibile."],"Having trouble using the plugin?":["Hai problemi a utilizzare il plugin?"],"Contact our friendly support team.":["Contatta il nostro cordiale team di assistenza."],"Go to Support Form":["Vai al modulo di supporto"],"Create a feed":["Crea un feed"],"Dashboard":["Bacheca"],"Create a Review feed":["Crea un feed di recensioni"],"more":[""],"Confirm":["Conferma"],"You are using the new Google Places API":[""],"New API":[""],"License Key ":["Chiave della licenza "],"Your ":["La tua "]," License is ":[" licenza \u00e8 "],"Active":["Attivo"],"Inactive":["Inattivo"],"Expired":["Scaduta"],"Manage License":["Gestisci la licenza"],"Test Connection":["Verifica la connessione"],"Connection Error":["Errore di connessione"],"Upgrade":["Aggiorna"],"Deactivate":["Disattiva"],"This source is not used by any feeds.":[""],"Are you sure you want to delete it?":[""],"feed":[""],"This source is used by":[""],"Delete ":["Elimina "],"Source Deleted!":["Fonte cancellata!"],"Select feed to export":[""],"Export":["Esporta"],"Original Text":["Testo originale"],"Custom text\/translation":["Testo personalizzato\/traduzione"],"Context":["Contesto"],"New Reviews collected daily.":["Nuove recensioni raccolte giornalmente."],"Clearing caches will trigger a full resync of all reviews. This may take a few minutes and could temporarily slow down your site.":[""],"Clear All Caches":["Cancella tutte le cache"],"You are using the Lite version of the plugin\u2013no license needed. Enjoy! \ud83d\ude42 To unlock more features, consider ":["Stai usando la versione Lite del plugin\u2013nessuna licenza necessaria. Buon divertimento! \ud83d\ude42 Per sbloccare altre caratteristiche, considera "],"Upgrading to Pro":["Aggiornamento alla versione Pro"],"As a valued user of our Lite plugin, you receive 50% OFF - automatically applied at checkout!":["Apprezziamo il fatto che tu sia utente del nostro plugin Lite: per questo ti offriamo il 50% di sconto, applicato automaticamente al momento del pagamento!"],"Install Pro":["Installa Pro"],"Select collection to export":[""],"Collection JSON exported!":[""],"Save Changes":["Salva le modifiche"],"Plugin Installed":["Plugin installato"],"Unknown Error":["Errore sconosciuto"],"Plugin Activated":["Plugin attivato"],"Plugin Deactivated":["Plugin disattivato"],"About Us":["Chi siamo"],"SmashBalloon Team":["Team di SmashBalloon"],"At Smash Balloon, we build software that helps you create beautiful responsive social media feeds for your website in minutes.":["Noi di Smash Balloon costruiamo un software che ti aiuta a creare bellissimi feed responsive per i social media del tuo sito web. Tutto in pochi minuti."],"We're on a mission to make it super simple to add social media feeds in WordPress. No more complicated setup steps, ugly iframe widgets, or negative page speed scores.":["La nostra missione \u00e8 rendere super semplice l'aggiunta dei feed dei social media in WordPress. Basta con le configurazioni complicate, i brutti widget iframe o i punteggi negativi sulla velocit\u00e0 della pagina."],"Our plugins aren't just easy to use, but completely customizable, reliable, and fast! Which is why over 1.6 million awesome users, just like you, choose to use them on their site.":["I nostri plugin non sono solo facili da usare, ma anche completamente personalizzabili, affidabili e veloci! Ecco perch\u00e9 oltre 1,6 milioni di persone fantastiche, proprio come te, scelgono di usarli sul proprio sito."],"Our Other Social Media Feed Plugins":["Gli altri nostri plugin per i feed dei social media"],"We're more than just a Reviews plugin! Check out our other plugins and add more content to your site.":["Non siamo solo un plugin per le recensioni! Dai un'occhiata agli altri plugin e aggiungi altro contenuto al tuo sito."],"Install":["Installa"],"Installed":["Installato"],"Social Wall":["Social Wall"],"Combine feeds from all of our plugins into a single wall":["Combina i feed di tutti i nostri plugin in un'unica schermata"],"Plugins we recommend":["Plugin che raccomandiamo"],"What are they used for?":[""],"Solving an issue in your plugin might sometime require testing API access but with your setup. We do not want to expose your API keys over support messages and hence we use a temporary login link system to securely access it.":[""],"What can a support executive access?":[""],"A support team member can only access Smash Balloon plugin to make API requests. They can NOT access any other plugins, create posts or in any way modify your WordPress website.":[""],"Can I disable or delete the temporary login link?":[""],"The login link is auto-destroyed in 14 days. You can also manually delete it any time you want.":[""],"Temporary Login Links":[""],"Dismiss":["Ignora"],"Search Documentation":["Ricerca nella documentazione"],"Need more support? We're here to help.":["Hai bisogno di ulteriore supporto? Siamo qui per aiutarti."],"Submit a Support Ticket":["Invia un ticket di supporto"],"Get Help in the WordPress.org Forum":["Chiedi aiuto al forum di WordPress.org"],"Our fast and friendly support team is always happy to help!":["Il nostro team di assistenza veloce e amichevole \u00e8 sempre felice di aiutarti!"],"System Info":["Informazioni di sistema"],"Collapse":["Riduci"],"Expand":["Espandi"],"Export Settings":["Impostazioni per l'esportazione"],"Share your plugin settings easily with Support":["Condividi con facilit\u00e0 le impostazioni del plugin con il team di Supporto."],"Temporary Login":[""],"Our team might require temporary login access with limited access to only our plugin to help you test your issues":[""],"Create Temporary Login Link":[""],"Temporary User Created":[""],"Temporary Login link for support access created by you. This is auto-destructed 14 days after creation. To create a new link, please delete the old one.":[""],"Link":["Link"],"Temporary User Deleted":[""],"Please enter you business name as it is in Google":[""],"Business name to search for Place ID":[""],"Business ID found":[""],"Clear Log":[""],"Code":[""],"Details":[""],"Moderate review feeds":["Modera i feed di recensioni"],"Display images and videos":["Visualizza immagini e video"],"Upsell Modal Icon":["Icona della modale Upsell"],"And get much more!":["E ottieni molto di pi\u00f9!"],"Add reviews to your collection":[""],"Organize reviews into collections, embed collections on any page":[""],"Collections help you organize your reviews in collections such as \u201cHomepage reviews\u201d or \u201cProduct reviews\u201d. You can then use them as a reviews source in any feed.":[""],"Add your first review to this collection":[""],"Add reviews from Google, Facebook, TrustPilot or Yelp. Collections help you hand-pick reviews and embed them on pages.":[""],"Create handpicked reviews collections to make the best first impression.":[""],"Or get them from your audience":[""],"You can also connect a form from WPForms or Formidable forms.":[""],"Add these collections as source on any feed. These work just like any other sources.":[""],"Name your Collection":[""],"Eg. Homepage Reviews":[""],"What are collections?":[""],"By duplicating this collection, all the reviews created and added to this collection will be duplicated too!":[""],"By deleting this collection, all the reviews created and added for it will be deleted too":[""],"Empty Collections Icon":[""],"Create collections of handpicked reviews to showcase them on your website, reviews page or product page":[""],"Okay, got it":[""],"Refresh List":[""],"No reviews found!":[""],"Add the review by manually typing it out":[""],"Or Add from existing source":[""],"Add the review from an existing source you have already connected":[""],"Select Reviewer Avatar Image":[""],"Use this media":[""],"Add Image to Review":[""],"You are about to edit this review":[""],"This review is displayed in":[""],"feeds. Editing it will change it on both those places. This action is irreversible.":[""],"User Avatar":[""],"Add Reviewer Image":[""],"Remove reviewer image":[""],"Rate %d star":[""],"Rate %d stars":[""],"First Name":[""],"John":[""],"Dow":[""],"The review title goes here":[""],"The content title goes here":[""],"Link to the review (Optional)":[""],"Posted on":[""],"Remove image":[""],"There are no reviews in this source, please select another source!":[""],"Selected Reviews added to your collection":[""],"Collection Name Updated":[""],"Back to All Collections":[""],"Rename collection":[""],"Update the Collection Name":[""],"Save collection name":[""],"Your collection adds any reviews submitted from this form to":[""],"Form Submissions":[""],"Collection actions":[""],"Turn your collection into a reviews feed":[""],"Import existing collections from another plugin":[""],"Form Submission":[""],"Get reviews submissions from your audience":[""],"With the help of WPForms or Formidable Forms, you can create a form and get submissions straight to a review collection.":[""],"Configure Form Submissions":[""],"Redirecting to Feed Editor":[""],"We have created a feed and added this collection as a source.":[""],"Get reviews directly from your audience":[""],"Connect forms (WPforms and Formidable are supported) or EDD to this collection and watch reviews gather automatically.":[""],"Looks like you do not have any compatible form plugin installed. Purchase WPForms and start setting up your form right away.":[""],"Purchase WPForms Pro":[""],"Looks like you do not have any compatible form plugin installed. Purchase Formidable forms Pro and start setting up your form right away.":[""],"Purchase Formidable Forms Pro":[""],"Install Easy Digital Downloads":[""],"Looks like you do not have any compatible form plugin installed. Purchase Easy Digital Downloads and start setting up your form right away.":[""],"Purchase Easy Digital Downloads":[""],"Cannot find a form?":[""],"To select a form, you need to first create a compatible form from templates":[""],"We are importing your form submissions":[""],"has 3 stars or more":[""],"has 4 stars or more":[""],"has 5 stars or more":[""],"is longer than":[""],"is shorter than":[""],"has 1 star or less":[""],"has 2 stars or less":[""],"has 3 stars or less":[""],"has 4 stars or less":[""],"has 5 stars or less":[""],"Configure forms that are allowed to add reviews to this collection.":[""],"Are you sure you want to disconnect this form?":[""],"Rules":[""],"Add rules to auto-approve or auto-delete form submissions":[""],"Collection form rules updated!":[""],"Auto Approve":[""],"Add posts to collection automatically if...":[""],"REVIEW":[""],"AND":[""],"200":[""],"Auto Archive":[""],"Archive form submission automatically if...":[""],"Reviews added from collection":[""],"Reviews archived from collection":[""],"Add To collection":[""],"Remove from collection":[""],"Delete Submissions":[""],"Loading connected forms submissions...":[""],"When your users submit reviews from a connected form, it will show up here.":[""],"Refresh submissions list":[""],"Remove from Collection":[""],"Delete submission":[""],"Reviews Unarchived from collection":[""],"Delete Submissions.":[""],"Are you sure you want to perman